  {
   "id": "cons",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 596,
   "width": 499,
   "height": 21,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100072,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700504,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Where the expensive guarantee is actually spent",
   "originalText": "Where the expensive guarantee is actually spent",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "cons2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 624,
   "width": 874,
   "height": 65,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100073,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700511,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "urls          strong on the WRITE, then freely eventual on reads - because the row is IMMUTABLE once written\ncode_counter  strictly linearizable, and it is touched once per 100,000 links, so it costs almost nothing\nRedis cache   eventual, bounded by a TTL clamped to min(1 hour, time until expiry)\nclick events  eventual, at-least-once - a double-counted click is a rounding error",
   "originalText": "urls          strong on the WRITE, then freely eventual on reads - because the row is IMMUTABLE once written\ncode_counter  strictly linearizable, and it is touched once per 100,000 links, so it costs almost nothing\nRedis cache   eventual, bounded by a TTL clamped to min(1 hour, time until expiry)\nclick events  eventual, at-least-once - a double-counted click is a rounding error",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "cons3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 726,
   "width": 689,
   "height": 48,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100074,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700518,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The luckiest property in this design: the strong-consistency requirement applies to a\nsingle-row insert whose shard key IS the code - so it needs no cross-shard\ncoordination, and the read path inherits none of it.",
   "originalText": "The luckiest property in this design: the strong-consistency requirement applies to a\nsingle-row insert whose shard key IS the code - so it needs no cross-shard\ncoordination, and the read path inherits none of it.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "sh",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1080,
   "y": 700,
   "width": 199,
   "height": 18,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100075,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700525,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Shard key: hash(code)",
   "originalText": "Shard key: hash(code)",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "sh2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1080,
   "y": 726,
   "width": 334,
   "height": 81,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100076,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700532,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Both the read and the write derive the\nshard from the only input either path\nhas - so every operation is single-shard.\nNot created_at (write hotspot), not\nowner_id (NULL, and unknown at redirect).",
   "originalText": "Both the read and the write derive the\nshard from the only input either path\nhas - so every operation is single-shard.\nNot created_at (write hotspot), not\nowner_id (NULL, and unknown at redirect).",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  }
